WEBVTT

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:06.196
AG: I meet a lot of people
who are pretty into their jobs.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.268
To gauge if they might
be a little obsessed,

00:19:08.292 --> 00:19:10.742
I like to ask, "Where's
the strangest place

00:19:10.766 --> 00:19:12.616
you've checked your work email?"

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:15.166
Joanne McMorrow: The ski lift,
going up the mountain,

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.666
with the winds and the snow
that was blowing at me.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:18.959
For some strange reason,

00:19:18.983 --> 00:19:21.935
I felt the need to pull the phone out,
pull the gloves off

00:19:21.959 --> 00:19:23.266
and check the email.

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:26.516
AG: This is Joanne McMorrow,
a director at Accenture.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:29.117
I think the chairlift phone check
firmly lands her

00:19:29.141 --> 00:19:31.796
in the category of engaged workaholic.